Block C — if time: an API with a contract
Your YouTube Data API key from last week, stored with usethis::edit_r_environ() as YOUTUBE_API_KEY=... (restart R afterwards).

yt &lt;- request("https://www.googleapis.com/youtube/v3/videos") |&gt;
  req_url_query(
    part = "snippet,statistics", chart = "mostPopular",
    regionCode = "US", maxResults = 10,
    key = Sys.getenv("YOUTUBE_API_KEY")
  ) |&gt;
  req_perform() |&gt;
  resp_body_json()

tibble(v = yt$items) |&gt;
  unnest_wider(v) |&gt;
  hoist(snippet, title = "title", channel = "channelTitle") |&gt;
  hoist(statistics, views = "viewCount") |&gt;
  select(id, title, channel, views)

